@bank all
// W3, rec deck: the fault words for the rec machines (RB's FAULT_CAUSES, claude/rec-works 0.84.1), in
// faults.lines' shape: fault.name/shows/sign/still/tried.<kind>.<cause>. still: you fitted THIS cause's part and it
// wasn't the problem (it never names the real cause). Settings (drift, tag) have no part, so no still or tried.

// poolfilter · cartridge
== fault.name.poolfilter.cartridge
- The filter cartridge is clogged
== fault.shows.poolfilter.cartridge
- the pool is cloudy
== fault.sign.poolfilter.cartridge
- The gauge reads high. The water is milky past the shallow end.
== fault.still.poolfilter.cartridge
- Fresh cartridge in. The water is still milky.
== fault.tried.poolfilter.cartridge
- New cartridge in. Still cloudy.

// poolfilter · seal
== fault.name.poolfilter.seal
- The housing seal is worn
== fault.shows.poolfilter.seal
- a drip under the housing
== fault.sign.poolfilter.seal
- A wet ring on the floor under the filter housing.
== fault.still.poolfilter.seal
- New seal fitted. Still a drip under the housing.
== fault.tried.poolfilter.seal
- New seal in. Still dripping.

// pooldoser · drift
== fault.name.pooldoser.drift
- The dosing sensor has drifted
== fault.shows.pooldoser.drift
- stinging eyes
- a green tinge
== fault.sign.pooldoser.drift
- The reading wanders. Swimmers come out red-eyed.

// pooldoser · relay
== fault.name.pooldoser.relay
- The pump relay has failed
== fault.shows.pooldoser.relay
- the dose has stopped
== fault.sign.pooldoser.relay
- The pump clicks but doesn't run.
== fault.still.pooldoser.relay
- New relay fitted. The pump runs, but the dose is still off.
== fault.tried.pooldoser.relay
- New relay in. Dose still off.

// poolheat · valve
== fault.name.poolheat.valve
- The heat valve is sticking
== fault.shows.poolheat.valve
- the pool runs cold
== fault.sign.poolheat.valve
- The return pipe is barely warm.
== fault.still.poolheat.valve
- New valve in. The return pipe is still cold.
== fault.tried.poolheat.valve
- New valve in. Pool still cold.

// poolheat · regulator
== fault.name.poolheat.regulator
- The heat regulator is failing
== fault.shows.poolheat.regulator
- the pool runs cold
== fault.sign.poolheat.regulator
- Warm by day, cold first thing in the morning.
== fault.still.poolheat.regulator
- New regulator fitted. Still cold first thing.
== fault.tried.poolheat.regulator
- New regulator in. Still cold in the mornings.

// riverpump · bearing
== fault.name.riverpump.bearing
- A pump bearing is worn
== fault.shows.riverpump.bearing
- the current pulses
== fault.sign.riverpump.bearing
- A rumble you can feel through the grating.
== fault.still.riverpump.bearing
- New bearing in. Still a rumble through the grating.
== fault.tried.riverpump.bearing
- New bearing in. Current still pulsing.

// riverpump · impeller
== fault.name.riverpump.impeller
- The impeller is worn
== fault.shows.riverpump.impeller
- the fast run goes slack
== fault.sign.riverpump.impeller
- Quiet, but the flow gauge reads low.
== fault.still.riverpump.impeller
- New impeller in. The flow still reads low.
== fault.tried.riverpump.impeller
- New impeller in. Fast run still slack.

// wavegate · relay
== fault.name.wavegate.relay
- The gate relay has failed
== fault.shows.wavegate.relay
- no standing wave
== fault.sign.wavegate.relay
- The gate light shows blue, but the gate doesn't move.
== fault.still.wavegate.relay
- New relay fitted. The gate still won't move.
== fault.tried.wavegate.relay
- New relay in. Still no wave.

// wavegate · seal
== fault.name.wavegate.seal
- A hydraulic seal is leaking
== fault.shows.wavegate.seal
- a slick on the bank
== fault.sign.wavegate.seal
- Oily water round the gate's post.
== fault.still.wavegate.seal
- New seal in. Still a slick by the post.
== fault.tried.wavegate.seal
- New seal in. Still leaking.

// wallholds · hold
== fault.name.wallholds.hold
- A hold has worked loose
== fault.shows.wallholds.hold
- a hold spins underfoot
== fault.sign.wallholds.hold
- A hold turns in your hand. The washer on its bolt has split.
== fault.still.wallholds.hold
- New washer on. That hold still turns.
== fault.tried.wallholds.hold
- New washer on. Another hold's still loose.

// belay · brake
== fault.name.belay.brake
- The belay brake is worn
== fault.shows.belay.brake
- it lowers too fast
== fault.sign.belay.brake
- The line pays out with a whine.
== fault.still.belay.brake
- New brake bearing in. It still lowers too fast.
== fault.tried.belay.brake
- New brake bearing in. Still too fast.

// belay · tag
== fault.name.belay.tag
- The belay's inspection is due
== fault.shows.belay.tag
- inspection due
== fault.sign.belay.tag
- The inspection tag has run out.

// stagelights · lamp
== fault.name.stagelights.lamp
- A stage lamp has blown
== fault.shows.stagelights.lamp
- a stage light is out
== fault.sign.stagelights.lamp
- One lamp in the truss is dark.
== fault.still.stagelights.lamp
- New lamp in. That spot on the stage is still dark.
== fault.tried.stagelights.lamp
- New lamp in. Still dark.

// stagelights · relay
== fault.name.stagelights.relay
- A dimmer relay is failing
== fault.shows.stagelights.relay
- the whole rig flickers
== fault.sign.stagelights.relay
- Every lamp stutters at once.
== fault.still.stagelights.relay
- New relay fitted. The rig still flickers.
== fault.tried.stagelights.relay
- New relay in. Rig still flickering.

// soundrack · amp
== fault.name.soundrack.amp
- The amplifier is failing
== fault.shows.soundrack.amp
- a hum
== fault.sign.soundrack.amp
- A low hum from every speaker, louder when it's warm.
== fault.still.soundrack.amp
- New regulator in the amp. Still humming.
== fault.tried.soundrack.amp
- New amp regulator in. Still a hum.

// soundrack · cable
== fault.name.soundrack.cable
- The mic cable is damaged
== fault.shows.soundrack.cable
- the lectern mic cuts out
== fault.sign.soundrack.cable
- The mic drops out when the cable is touched.
== fault.still.soundrack.cable
- New cable run. The mic still cuts out.
== fault.tried.soundrack.cable
- New cable in. Mic still cutting out.

// seathinges · hinge
== fault.name.seathinges.hinge
- A seat hinge is worn
== fault.shows.seathinges.hinge
- a seat won't fold
== fault.sign.seathinges.hinge
- A seat stuck down, and a squeak from its neighbours.
== fault.still.seathinges.hinge
- New hinge pin in. That seat still sticks.
== fault.tried.seathinges.hinge
- New pin in. The next seat still squeaks.

// courtnet · coil
== fault.name.courtnet.coil
- An emitter coil is failing
== fault.shows.courtnet.coil
- the net flickers
== fault.sign.courtnet.coil
- The net stutters, then drops for a breath.
== fault.still.courtnet.coil
- New coil winding in. The net still flickers.
== fault.tried.courtnet.coil
- New coil in. Net still flickering.

// courtnet · power
== fault.name.courtnet.power
- A power unit is failing
== fault.shows.courtnet.power
- the side walls fade
== fault.sign.courtnet.power
- The side fields dim. The power units whine.
== fault.still.courtnet.power
- New breaker fitted. The side walls still fade.
== fault.tried.courtnet.power
- New breaker in. Walls still fading.

// scoreboard · panel
== fault.name.scoreboard.panel
- A scoreboard panel has failed
== fault.shows.scoreboard.panel
- dead pixels in the scores
== fault.sign.scoreboard.panel
- A dark block in the home score.
== fault.still.scoreboard.panel
- New panel lamp in. Still a dark block in the score.
== fault.tried.scoreboard.panel
- New panel in. Still a dark block.

// scoreboard · driver
== fault.name.scoreboard.driver
- The board's driver has failed
== fault.shows.scoreboard.driver
- the board shows nonsense
== fault.sign.scoreboard.driver
- The names scramble. "Pell 11, You banana."
== fault.still.scoreboard.driver
- New signal card in. The board still talks nonsense.
== fault.tried.scoreboard.driver
- New card in. Still scrambled.

// gravplate · controller
== fault.name.gravplate.controller
- The gravity controller has drifted
== fault.shows.gravplate.controller
- gravity creeps back up
== fault.sign.gravplate.controller
- The gauge drifts towards a full g.
== fault.still.gravplate.controller
- New signal card in. Gravity still creeps up.
== fault.tried.gravplate.controller
- New card in. Gravity still creeping.

// gravplate · cooling
== fault.name.gravplate.cooling
- The plates' cooling pump is failing
== fault.shows.gravplate.cooling
- the room closes itself
== fault.sign.gravplate.cooling
- The cooling loop is hot to the touch.
== fault.still.gravplate.cooling
- New pump in. The cooling loop is still hot.
== fault.tried.gravplate.cooling
- New pump in. Still running hot.
